6507 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Performance aboard the UESC Marathon is measured by your understanding and execution of assigned responsibilities\056\n\nThe vessel\054 its various decks\054 its many overlapping systems\054 and its inhabitants depend on adherence to security protocols to maintain functionality and general operational integrity\056 All systems include important operational safeguards designed to prevent asset loss\054 data breaches\054 and unauthorized access\056\n\nThe Cryo Archive and the security of its supporting systems are the focus of this section in the P\056S\056L\056M\056 Certification Module\054 with an emphasis on unassisted manual considerations \050read\072 operator\055driven without the assistance of ancillary intelligence support\051\056\n\nThe goal of this manual is to train and educate you\024the operator\024to access and interact with system security measures without the aid of full automated intelligence support\056\n\nBefore engaging with any sealed structure within the Cryo Archive\054 personnel must complete P\056S\056L\056M\056 training\056 The following chapters outline approved procedures for interacting with multi\021layered lock assemblies and phased access mechanisms\056\n\nFor the purposes of this training this manual will focus on remote access manipulation of Preservation systems locks via cryoarchives\056system\056\n\nIdentifying and tracing backdoor access as a workaround to compromised system lock integrity will require both digital systems management and active colony zone\055focused operational hacks to craft the necessary backdoor access\056\n\050\nPlease read this manual carefully\056)
     /K [ 21 ]
     /P 6508 0 R
     /Pg 615 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

6508 0 obj
  << /K [ 6507 0 R ]
     /P 6513 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 615 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

6509 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Preservation systems locks utilize phased protection layers\056 Tampering with security measures without proper authorization introduces structural risk and may trigger containment countermeasures\056\n\nHowever\054 it may become necessary to engage these locks remotely in order to counter damage\054 corruption\054 or unauthorized control of a region\031s security features\056 This training is a guide to the baseline operations of Preservations phased protections for use by authorized maintenance personnel\056\n\nUnauthorized manipulation of systems locks constitutes a violation of UESC Marathon bylaws \050Articles 40A\02360H\051\056 Offenders will be reported\054 detained\054 and subject to prosecution\056\n\nProceed only when fully briefed and cleared for intervention\056)
     /K [ 22 ]
     /P 6510 0 R
     /Pg 615 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

