6903 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Each configuration responds differently depending on serial classification and rotational orientation\056 Incorrect initialization may cause cascading reversals within the grid\056\n\nDirectional notation within this section refers to execution order\054 not movement\056\n\nTo run the correct setup initialization\054 keep the following in mind\072 West of the Flight Control\054 you encounter a similar Cable Management System \050C\056M\056S\056\051 illuminated by a pink\057red light\056 Then execute Section specific material according to the above instructions\056\n\nIf the S\057N is not HA9TI50A20 and does not end on a 0 and has more than 2 vowels\054 rotate the pattern on cryoarchive\056systems by 90 degrees\056 Then input cable connections as specified in C\056M\056S\056 and follow SET 1\056\n\nIf the S\057N has 2 directly repeating numbers but the sum of the numbers in the S\057N is lower than 10\054 disregard all the above and grant power to the slots in the C\056M\056S after rotating the pattern counterclockwise 90 degrees\056 Then follow SET 15 if it ends on a number otherwise use SET 1\056\n\nIf the S\057N starts with a vowel and ends with a letter then disregard all the above information and grant and grant power to all slots after rotating the pattern counterclockwise 90 degrees and follow SET 13\056\n\nIf the S\057N has more than 2 zeros\054 disregard all the above information and grant power to all slots with a cable connected after you rotate the pattern clockwise by 270 degrees\054 follow the highest SET\056\n\nIf the S\057N ends and starts with a letter and the 2nd letter is not a vowel disregard all the above information and grant power to all slots without a cable after you rotate the box 90 degrees clockwise follow SET 1\056\n\nIf the sum of all numbers in the S\057N is 27 disregard all of the previous instructions and grant power to the slots in rows that has no cables connected after you rotate the box 90 degrees and use SET 15\056\n\nFor any other S\057N instead rotate the cable connections in the C\056M\056S 270 degrees and grant power to the slots with a cable connected\056 If the S\057N ends on an even number use SET 1\054 if it ends on an odd number use SET 15\054 if the last 3 characters are numbers use SET 13\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 6904 0 R
     /Pg 2477 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

