7129 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Distributed supply containers were deployed across operational zones as part of a layered security rehearsal\056\n\nEach container functions as a remote authentication anchor\056\n\nSerial identifiers embedded within these units are used to verify that field personnel can correctly retrieve\054 record\054 and transmit access credentials under live environmental conditions\056\nFailure to retrieve accurate serial designations compromises indexing integrity and may result in clearance denial for higher\021tier Preservation systems\056\n\nThe UESC Marathon does not rely solely on centralized locks\056 Security is distributed\056\n\nCompletion of surface confirmation exercises ensures personnel readiness for phased access environments\054 including Cryo Archive subsystems\056\n\nRecorded serials must then be cross\021referenced against foundational documentation to determine final access parameters\056 Numerical position corresponds to the documented sequence\056)
     /K [ 64 ]
     /P 7130 0 R
     /Pg 3075 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

