9036 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Instructions\n\nIf the S\057N contains 25\054 cut the same color of the cable that is next to 25 when the timer contains the amount of cables next to 25\056\240\n\nElse if there are an equal amount of red boxes to the amount of zeros in the S\057N cut the wire that has the same color of the box adjacent to 29 when the timer contains 2 in any position\056\n\nElse if the number of vowels in the S\057N matches the number of white boxes and it has no T\031s\054 you should cut the blue wire when the timer contains the largest number in the S\057N in any position\056\n\nElse if there are exactly 4 white cables connected\054 cut the Magenta wire when the timer contains 0 in any position no matter what\056\n\nElse if the number of cables connected matches the amount of letters in the S\057N\054 cut the white cable when the timer contains the number of cables connected in any position\056\n\nElse if the sum of the numbers in the S\057N plus the amount of white boxes is equal to a number that exists as both the first and the last number on the capped power nodes and is larger than 1\054 cut the purple wire when the timer contains the sum of the numbers in the S\057N in any position\056\n\nElse if the last number of the serial minus the rest\054 amounts to the number of unique numbers on the capped power nodes\054 cut the orange cable when the timer contains 7 in any position\056\056\n\nElse if the amount of cables that are directly adjacent to two identical numbers matches the number of M\031s in the S\057N\054 cut the Green cable when the timer contains 5 in any position\056\n\nElse if the capped power nodes with the number 29 is directly next to a white box and the S\057N ends on O cut the Light red cable when the timer contains the amount of 7\031s that exist in the S\057N and on capped power nodes in any position\056\n\nElse if the amount of connected blue cables matches the final number in the S\057N cut the Yellow wire when the timer contains 1 in any position\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 9037 0 R
     /Pg 6062 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

